18:T169e,<section class="privacy-policy" aria-label="GameShop Nepal Privacy Policy">
<p><em>Effective Date: June 4, 2026</em></p>
<p>GameShop Nepal ("we", "us", "our") respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information. By using our website <a href="https://gameshopnepal.com">gameshopnepal.com</a> or any related WhatsApp/messaging service, you agree to this Policy.</p>

<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>We only collect what is necessary to deliver your order and provide support:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Contact details:</strong> Name, WhatsApp number, email address.</li>
<li><strong>Payment details:</strong> eSewa ID, Khalti ID, bank reference, or payment screenshot. We do <strong>not</strong> store credit card or full bank account numbers.</li>
<li><strong>Account identifiers:</strong> Game Player ID, Server ID, Riot ID, Gmail, Spotify email, Microsoft email — only as needed for the specific product you ordered.</li>
<li><strong>Order details:</strong> Products purchased, order amount, delivery status, support history.</li>
<li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type, device type, and pages visited, collected automatically when you use our website.</li>
</ul>

<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<ul>
<li>To process and deliver your order (top-ups, subscriptions, accounts).</li>
<li>To send order confirmations, delivery notifications, and replacement guarantees via WhatsApp or email.</li>
<li>To provide customer support and resolve disputes.</li>
<li>To prevent fraud, chargebacks, and abuse of our service.</li>
<li>To improve our website, products, and pricing based on aggregated, non-personal usage data.</li>
<li>To comply with applicable laws in Nepal.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. What We Do NOT Do</h2>
<ul>
<li>❌ We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or trade your personal data to third parties.</li>
<li>❌ We do <strong>not</strong> share your Player IDs or account credentials with anyone outside our delivery team.</li>
<li>❌ We do <strong>not</strong> send marketing spam — communications are limited to your order and support.</li>
<li>❌ We do <strong>not</strong> store payment card details — local payments (eSewa, Khalti, bank) handle their own data.</li>
</ul>

<h2>4. Sharing With Third Parties</h2>
<p>Limited sharing happens only with:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Payment processors</strong> (eSewa, Khalti, FonePay, banks) — to verify your payment.</li>
<li><strong>Service providers</strong> (Netflix, Spotify, PUBG Midasbuy, etc.) — only the minimum information required to activate or top up your product.</li>
<li><strong>Hosting providers</strong> (Emergent.sh, MongoDB) — they store our website and database under industry-standard security.</li>
<li><strong>Law enforcement</strong> — if legally required under Nepali law.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Cookies & Tracking</h2>
<p>Our website uses essential cookies to keep you logged in, remember cart items, and track session activity. We may use analytics tools (Google Analytics, Google Search Console) to understand how visitors use the site. You can disable cookies in your browser, but some features may not work properly.</p>

<h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Order data:</strong> Retained for up to 3 years for tax, replacement, and dispute purposes.</li>
<li><strong>Payment screenshots:</strong> Stored for 12 months, then deleted unless needed for an active dispute.</li>
<li><strong>WhatsApp chat history:</strong> Retained according to WhatsApp's own retention rules.</li>
<li><strong>Account credentials we provide you:</strong> Once delivered, we do not log into your accounts.</li>
</ul>

<h2>7. Data Security</h2>
<p>We use SSL/HTTPS encryption across our website, restricted admin access (only authorized staff can view customer data), and managed database hosting. However, no online service can guarantee 100% security. We will notify affected customers if a data breach occurs.</p>

<h2>8. Your Rights</h2>
<p>You have the right to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you.</li>
<li>Request correction of inaccurate data.</li>
<li>Request deletion of your data (subject to our 3-year tax retention requirement).</li>
<li>Withdraw consent for marketing communications at any time.</li>
<li>Lodge a complaint with us at <a href="mailto:support@gameshopnepal.com">support@gameshopnepal.com</a>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>Our services are intended for users aged 13 and above. We do not knowingly collect data from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data, contact us immediately and we will delete it.</p>

<h2>10. Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>Our website may link to third-party services (Netflix, Spotify, YouTube, etc.). Once you leave gameshopnepal.com, this Privacy Policy no longer applies — please read each service's own privacy policy.</p>

<h2>11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be highlighted on this page with an updated "Effective Date". Continued use of our service after changes means you accept the updated Policy.</p>

<h2>12. Contact Us</h2>
<p>For any privacy-related questions, requests, or complaints, contact:</p>
<ul>
<li>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@gameshopnepal.com">support@gameshopnepal.com</a></li>
<li>📱 <strong>WhatsApp:</strong> <a href="https://wa.me/9779743488871">+977 9743488871</a></li>
<li>🌐 <strong>Website:</strong> <a href="https://gameshopnepal.com">gameshopnepal.com</a></li>
<li>📍 <strong>Location:</strong> Butwal, Lumbini Province, Nepal</li>
</ul>

<p><em>Last updated: June 4, 2026</em></p>
</section>d:["$","$L17",null,{"initialData":{"page_key":"privacy","content":"$18","title":"Privacy Policy","updated_at":"2026-06-04T16:31:01.858985+00:00"}}]
